WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.016
Every sign-in, booking, record opened, and export is written to the audit log.

2
00:00:06.016 --> 00:00:10.422
It cannot be edited or deleted by the center. The database itself refuses.

3
00:00:10.422 --> 00:00:14.453
A full export of the center's data is one page away.

4
00:00:14.453 --> 00:00:17.797
If you ever leave Sympraxi, you take everything with you.
